data: {"id": "5f10ec1ba53e4b4a-thinking-parallel_evidence-1153", "run_id": "5f10ec1ba53e4b4a", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实\n\n1. **Pod 生命周期**：\n   - 状态为 **Pending**，容器 `app` 状态为 **Waiting: ImagePullBackOff**。\n   - 镜像为 `registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing`。\n   - Restart Count = 0，容器未启动过。\n   - Pod UID: `91141823-4070-43a3-810c-ddbf5a6b337f`，节点 `node2`，IP `172.16.104.46`。\n\n2. **Events（关键证据）**：\n   - 38 分钟前首次 `ErrImagePull`，事件原文：\n     ```\n     Failed to pull image \"registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing\": \n     failed to resolve reference \"registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing\": \n     failed to do request: H", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789042981394, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

